  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tropical Cyclone Lola Emergency Response Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of activities relating to the provision of life preserving services for communities affected by the following natural disaster: Tropical Cyclone Lola.

The Grant proceeds will be used for activities including but not limited to: (i) provision of medical kits, food, and bottled drinking water; (ii) purchase of water purification and sanitation systems; (iii) provision of transitional shelter; (iv) provision of personal hygiene kits; and (v) covering the additional costs of critical health and related services.</narrative>
  </description>
